%N A400533 Expansion of Product_{k>=1} theta_3(q^k)^k, where theta_3() is the Jacobi theta function.
%H A400533 Vaclav Kotesovec, <a href="/A400533/b400533.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%F A400533 a(n) ~ (7*zeta(3)/Pi)^(13/72) * exp((63*Pi^2*zeta(3))^(1/3) * n^(2/3) / 4 + 1/24) / (sqrt(A) * 2^(25/24) * (3*n)^(49/72)), where A is the Glaisher-Kinkelin constant A074962.
%t A400533 nmax = 50; CoefficientList[Series[Product[EllipticTheta[3, 0, x^k]^k, {k, 1, nmax}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
